2025-10-08 12:29:50,765 [WARNING] Skipped idx=560: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='The expression of TAP73 and DeltaNP73 in malignant gliomas. The p73 gene encodes transcriptionally active TAp73, as well as a dominant-negative acting DeltaNp73 transcript isoform. We studied differential expression of these forms in normal brain and glial tumors using semiquantitative RT-PCR. In the context of malignant gliomas, the up-regulation of TAp73, particularly TAp73α, has been associated with tumor progression and the inactivation of the retinoblastoma pathway. This suggests that the primary isoform of TAp73, TAp73α, plays a significant role in the pathogenesis of malignant gliomas.'
