2025-10-08 12:29:50,872 [WARNING] Skipped idx=589: gold or llm supporting sentence is empty. gold='', llm='Supporting sentence: In humans, three TAp73 isoforms have been identified: TAp73α, TAp73β, and TAp73γ. These isoforms are products of alternative splicing of the p73 gene and are characterized by their pro-apoptotic properties. The extrinsic P1 promoter is responsible for the expression of these TAp73 isoforms, and its activity can be regulated by DNA methylation. Hypomethylation of the P1 promoter has been associated with reduced expression of TAp73 mRNAs, although this is relatively infrequent in primary non-small cell lung carcinomas (NSCLCs). In contrast, the intrinsic P2 promoter, which controls the expression of the anti-apoptotic ΔNp73 isoform, is often hypomethylated, leading to over-expression of ΔNp73 mRNA, particularly in squamous cell carcinomas. This over-expression of ΔNp73 mRNA is strongly correlated with LINE-1 element hypomethylation, suggesting that it may be a passive consequence of global DNA hypomethylation.'
